DHI packaging builds only run :nessie-quarkus:quarkusBuild and do not publish to Gradle Enterprise or Maven Central.
Upstream settings.gradle.kts applies com.gradle.develocity and com.gradleup.nmcp.settings for CI workflows that need outbound access to plugins.gradle.org and Sonatype.
Reference: https://github.com/projectnessie/nessie/blob/nessie-0.109.0/settings.gradle.kts
